        "new_string": "## Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n  index.ts    - Main entry point\n  utils.ts    - Utility functions\n  cli/\n    validate-yaml.ts  - YAML validator CLI\n  yaml/\n    types.ts    - Type definitions\n    lexer.ts    - YAML tokenizer\n    parser.ts   - YAML syntax validator\n```\n\n## YAML Validator\n\nValidate YAML file syntax without external dependencies.\n\n### Usage\n\n```bash\nbun run validate-yaml config.yaml\n```\n\n### Output\n\n**Valid file:**\n```\nValid YAML: config.yaml\n```\nExit code: 0\n\n**Invalid file:**\n```\nconfig.yaml:15:8: Unexpected indentation\n```\nExit code: 1\n\n**Missing file:**\n```\nError: File not found: nonexistent.yaml\n```\nExit code: 1"
